{#
    contentSection(id, number, eyebrow, title, aside, below, classes, headingLevel)
    - Generic numbered content section: circular number badge + small eyebrow label + big
      title + divider, then a freeform body passed as the call block. One shared widget for
      every section of a longer explainer page (e.g. Soutěže) instead of bespoke markup per
      section:
      {% call contentSection(number=1, eyebrow="Regionální liga jednotlivců", title="Oblastní soutěže jednotlivců") %}
          <p>...</p>
      {% endcall %}
    - number/eyebrow: both optional — omit `number` for an unnumbered section, omit both to
      drop the eyebrow row entirely.
    - The body (call block) always sits in a ~2/3-width main column, with the remaining ~1/3
      reserved as a right-hand sidebar column — even when `aside` is empty, so every section
      keeps the same reading width and there's always room to drop sidebar content in later.
      Nunjucks macros only get one call block, so sidebar content is passed as a pre-rendered
      string instead — build it with {% set aside %}...{% endset %} above the call:
      {% set aside %}
          <div class="c-content-section__card">...</div>
      {% endset %}
      {% call contentSection(title="...", aside=aside) %}...{% endcall %}
    - below: same pre-rendered-string idea, but rendered full-width *below* the 2/3+1/3 grid —
      for content that shouldn't be squeezed into the main column (e.g. the category tile
      grid on "Mistrovství ČR v kategoriích").
    - id: optional anchor id, so a jumpNav() (or any other in-page link) can scroll to this
      section — see .c-content-section's scroll-margin-top, which clears the sticky header.
    - Minimal on purpose today (just a header + main/aside/below slots); expect more options
      here as these sections grow (see ui-component-guide.md).
    - headingLevel: "h2" (default) | "h3"
#}
{% macro contentSection(
    id="",
    number="",
    eyebrow="",
    title="",
    aside="",
    below="",
    classes="",
    headingLevel="h2"
) %}
<section{% if id %} id="{{ id }}"{% endif %} class="{{ ["c-section", "c-content-section", classes] | select | join(" ") }}">
    <div class="c-container">
        <header class="c-content-section__header">
            {% if number or eyebrow %}
                <div class="c-content-section__eyebrow">
                    {% if number %}<span class="c-content-section__number">{{ number }}</span>{% endif %}
                    {% if eyebrow %}<span class="c-content-section__eyebrow-text">{{ eyebrow }}</span>{% endif %}
                </div>
            {% endif %}
            <{{ headingLevel }} class="c-content-section__title">{{ title }}</{{ headingLevel }}>
        </header>

        <div class="c-content-section__grid">
            <div class="c-content-section__body">
                {{ caller() }}
            </div>
            {% if aside %}
                <div class="c-content-section__aside">
                    {{ aside | safe }}
                </div>
            {% endif %}
        </div>

        {% if below %}
            <div class="c-content-section__below">
                {{ below | safe }}
            </div>
        {% endif %}
    </div>
</section>
{% endmacro %}
